1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:03,240
[cloned voice] Mom? It's me… I'm in trouble. I need money. Right now!

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:05,030
That isn't Sam. It's an AI clone.

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:06,750
Made from 3 seconds of audio.

4
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:08,910
One clip from social media can be enough.

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,050
Now watch the script.

6
00:00:10,150 --> 00:00:11,420
[cloned voice] Please, don't tell Dad!

7
00:00:11,550 --> 00:00:12,600
Urgency. Secrecy.

8
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:14,870
[cloned voice] Just buy gift cards. Or send crypto!

9
00:00:15,150 --> 00:00:16,600
That combo is always a scam.

10
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:20,990
Americans lost $3.5 billion to impostor scams last year.

11
00:00:21,750 --> 00:00:25,120
Oh, and this voice? Also AI. Every voice in this video is.

12
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:26,890
Fooled you? Then it can fool your mom.

13
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,210
So tonight, pick a safe word for your family.

14
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:31,930
No safe word? Hang up. Call back on a number you know.

15
00:00:32,050 --> 00:00:33,140
Send this to your parents.

16
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:34,190
Follow for more.
